{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553660/extras/57bd374934c1ceea6b0a1aed26f51e1b.avif?t=1771781506\" width=1201 height=237 /></span><strong><i>Fetch Quest Remastered</i></strong> is a visual novel that expands the hit game <strong><i>Fetch Quest</i></strong> with more content, upgraded graphics and unlockable extras through different story routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553660/extras/a38156aceea66218e1bf3469057e5d7e.avif?t=1771781506\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would-be adventurer Flora accepts a job to retrieve a stolen item for a shady bartender. To retrieve the item, she'll have to infiltrate a group of notorious bandits by posing as a new recruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, she has the help of two other adventurers\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026unfortunately, they are completely useless without her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the strangely vocal narrator, this would have gone more smoothly if <i>everyone</i> had remembered to make their characters beforehand...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Flora and her (poorly-prepared) companions Connor and Todd on their role-playing (mis)adventure and help them complete the quest that their resourceful Dungeon Master has planned for them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553660/extras/f99c52d4f7bbf7e2e98296df47f904f6.avif?t=1771781506\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>multiple endings</strong> depending on your choices in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game remastered with <strong>HD graphics and illustrations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your heart and <strong>choose between two love interests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>additional content</strong> through your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new <strong>True Ending</strong> that leads into a sequel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0~<strong>2 hours</strong> of reading time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 internet meme</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553660/extras/7b3ec9fbc9b32bd967f84a6114517db9.avif?t=1771781506\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2553660?t=1771781506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2553660?t=1771781506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553660/25310fa0a65d78c126e456581f5e6d8c981875e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771781506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553660/25310fa0a65d78c126e456581f5e6d8c981875e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771781506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"